<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>REBORN — Horde Guild | WoW Forever</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --black: #0a0a0f;
            --deep-purple: #2D0C5E;
            --rich-purple: #4B0082;
            --light-purple: #7B1FA2;
            --gold: #FFD700;
            --gold-dim: #B8860B;
            --text-light: #E8E8E8;
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        
        body {
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--text-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        
        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-purple), var(--rich-purple));
            padding: 1.2rem;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(123, 31, 162, 0.4);
        }
        
        nav .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6);
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }
        
        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--gold);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);
        }
        
        /* Page Container */
        .page {
            display: none;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease;
        }
        
        .page.active {
            display: block;
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        /* Home Page */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(75, 0, 130, 0.3), rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.9));
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 4.5rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
        }
        
        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--light-purple);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .launch-date {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: inline-block;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .hero p {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #ccc;
        }
        
        .section-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45, 12, 94, 0.4), rgba(75, 0, 130, 0.2));
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
        }
        
        .section-box h3 {
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        
        /* Forum Page */
        .forum-category {
            background: rgba(45, 12, 94, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(123, 31, 162, 0.4);
        }
        
        .forum-header {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--deep-purple), var(--rich-purple));
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold-dim);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--gold);
        }
        
        .forum-post {
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 31, 162, 0.2);
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .forum-post:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        
        .forum-post:hover {
            background: rgba(123, 31, 162, 0.15);
        }
        
        .post-title {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }
        
        .post-title:hover {
            color: var(--gold);
        }
        
        .post-meta {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #888;
        }
        
        .new-thread-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-dim), var(--gold));
            color: var(--black);
            border: none;
            padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .new-thread-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        
        /* Gallery Page */
        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.2rem;
        }
        
        .gallery-card {
            background: rgba(45, 12, 94, 0.4);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .gallery-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--gold);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15);
        }
        
        .gallery-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-purple), var(--rich-purple));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--gold);
        }
        
        .gallery-caption {
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        
        h2.page-title {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rich-purple);
        }
        
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--rich-purple);
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Navigation -->
<nav>
    <div class="nav-container">
        <div class="logo">⚔️ REBORN</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#" onclick="showPage('home')" class="active" id="nav-home">Home</a>
            <a href="#" onclick="showPage('forum')" id="nav-forum">Forum</a>
            <a href="#" onclick="showPage('gallery')" id="nav-gallery">Gallery</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<!-- HOME PAGE -->
<div class="page active" id="page-home">
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>REBORN</h1>
        <h2>HORDE GUILD — WoW Forever</h2>
        <div class="launch-date">🚀 Launching: 4th November 2026</div>
        <p>We rise, we fall, we are REBORN. Join us on WoW Forever as we build a legendary Horde community — raiding, PvP, dungeons, and family. New and experienced players welcome.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="section-box">
        <h3>🔥 Who We Are</h3>
        <p>REBORN is a brand new Horde guild launching alongside the WoW Forever server on November 4th, 2026. We are building a community focused on progression, respect, and having fun. Whether you're a veteran raider or just starting your journey, you have a place here.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="section-box">
        <h3>🎯 Our Goals</h3>
        <p>• Establish a strong, active Horde community<br>
        • Clear all raid content together<br>
        • Friendly atmosphere — no toxicity<br>
        • Help each other grow and gear up<br>
        • Make memories that last</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="section-box">
        <h3>📢 Join Us</h3>
        <p>Interested? Speak to an officer in-game or drop a message on our Forum! Recruitment is open now — spots are filling fast. Let's conquer Azeroth together.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- FORUM PAGE -->
<div class="page" id="page-forum">
    <h2 class="page-title">📝 Guild Forum</h2>
    <button class="new-thread-btn">+ New Thread</button>
    
    <div class="forum-category">
        <div class="forum-header">📢 Announcements</div>
        <div class="forum-post">
            <a href="#" class="post-title">🎉 REBORN — Official Launch & Recruitment Open!</a>
